[{"title":"花生日诗魏塘道中作","author":"舒位","text":"啼莺如梦送归艎，日子平分夜未央。\n愿取鸳鸯湖里水，酿成春酒寄花尝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2255,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杨花诗","author":"舒位","text":"歌残杨柳武昌城，扑面飞花管送迎。\n三月水流春太老，六朝人去雪无声。\n较量妾命谁当薄，吹落邻家尔许轻。\n我住天涯最飘荡，看渠如此不胜情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2256,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卧龙冈作","author":"舒位","text":"象床宝帐悄无言，草得降书又几番？\n两表涕零前出塞，一官安乐老称藩。\n祠官香火三间屋，大将星辰五丈原。\n异代萧条吾怅望，斜阳满树暮云蘩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2257,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"木兰花慢 武林归舟中作","author":"董士锡","text":"看斜阳一缕，刚送得，片帆归。\n正岸绕孤城，波回野渡，月暗闲堤。\n依稀是谁相忆？\n但轻魂如梦逐烟飞。\n赢得双双泪眼，从教涴尽罗衣。\n江南几日又天涯，谁与寄相思？\n怅夜夜霜花，空林开遍，也只侬知。\n安排十分秋色，便芳菲总是别离时。\n惟有醉将醽醁，任他柔橹轻移。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2258,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虞美人","author":"董士锡","text":"韶华争肯偎人住？\n已是滔滔去。\n西风无赖过江来，历尽千山万水几时回？\n秋声带叶萧萧落，莫响城头角！\n浮云遮月不分明，谁挽长江一洗放天青？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2259,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"三折岭望黄山","author":"董法海","text":"回头三折望黄山，客路匆匆山自闲。\n寄语芙蓉峰六六，相思都在白云间。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2260,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浔溪棹歌","author":"董恂","text":"米凭转斗接青黄，加一钱多幸已偿。\n二月新丝五月谷，为谁辛苦为谁忙？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2261,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"瘗鹤","author":"董晓山","text":"长蛇嘘雾毒暗天，老鹤俯视心为怜。\n引雏振翮下啄蛇，反为蛇噬身不全。\n嗟嗟鹤死群鹤怨，中有一鹤负机变。\n徘徊蛇旁衔骨归，瘗之中野酬孤愿。\n此中地气大吉非偶然，蛇灭雾息还青天，老鹤心魂耿耿悬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2262,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"响鞋廊","author":"蒋士铨","text":"不重雄封重艳情，遗踪犹自慕倾城。\n怜伊几两平生屐，踏碎山河是此声！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2263,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画","author":"蒋士铨","text":"不写晴山写雨山，似呵明镜照烟鬟。\n人间万象模糊好，风马云车便往还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2264,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岁暮到家","author":"蒋士铨","text":"爱子心无尽，归家喜及辰。\n寒衣针线密，家信墨痕新。\n见面怜清瘦，呼儿问苦辛。\n低回愧人子，不敢叹风尘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2265,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"湖上晚归","author":"蒋士铨","text":"湿云鸦背重，野寺出新晴。\n败叶存秋气，寒钟过雨声。\n半檐群鸟入，深树一镫明。\n猎猎西风劲，湖心月乍生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2266,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"开先瀑布","author":"蒋士铨","text":"瀑布之水源何来。\n划然下裂长峰开。\n下士目骇自天落。\n绝顶乃有千盘回。\n青山断缺耸双剑，元气直泻岩头摧。\n飞流已出不肯下，一线中折分潆洄。\n隐现数折蓄精锐，失势一落如奔雷。\n跳波乱击潭水立，怪物潜伏宁髻。\n音声顷刻逐千变，万马赴敌金鼙催。\n天光半壁照空谷，此地万古无阴霾。\n积雪挂千仞，山中猿鹤犹惊猜。\n银花下散布水台，混沌凿破山根隈。\n擘窠大字洗不尽，铁画满地镌青苔。\n太白已往老坡死，我辈且乏徐凝才。\n恶诗走笔不敢写，册亭煮汲烧松钗。\n来朝竹杖青芒，凌风踏碎烟云堆。\n飞泉三叠绝倚旁，坐观一洗尘氛怀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2267,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江泛","author":"蒋士铨","text":"二百里江光，群山绕建康。\n滔滔随眼白，荡荡接天黄。\n战骨多沉海，芦花又戴霜。\n六朝先后灭，何处说兴亡！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2268,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水调歌头十二首 其四","author":"蒋士铨","text":"偶为共命鸟，都是可怜虫。\n泪与秋河相似，点点注天东。\n十载楼中新妇，九载天涯夫婿，首已似飞蓬。\n年光愁病里，心绪别离中。\n咏春蚕，疑夏雁，泣秋蛩。\n几见珠围翠绕，含笑坐东风。\n闻道十分消瘦，为我两番磨折，辛苦念梁鸿。\n谁知千里夜，各对一灯红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2269,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题梅杓司藏卷，卷中乃诞北、颖侯、昆铜、伯宗、定生五亡友手札","author":"蒋易","text":"乍开此卷即沾巾，多是当年死难人。\n浩气尚能凝碧血，遗言终不化青磷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2270,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题梅杓司藏卷，卷中乃诞北、颖侯、昆铜、伯","author":"蒋易","text":"梅生海内结交繁，架上邮筒无数存。\n独宝数公残翰墨，欲留书种在乾坤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2271,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题梅杓司藏卷，卷中乃诞北、颖侯、昆铜、伯","author":"蒋易","text":"余公亢烈首捐躯，周沈同心亦与俱。\n莫羡陈刘考终命，肝肠寸折眼全枯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2272,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"十五夜默庵招饮","author":"蒋易","text":"应为冰蟾好，羁凄共野亭。\n醉开双泪眼，寒动一天星。\n战鼓春风寂，渔灯夜气腥。\n炉存先世物，香爇蔗浆青。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2273,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乱后过瓜洲旧居","author":"蒋易","text":"鸟散瓜洲渡，书归杨仆船。\n荒城无马迹，广厦几人烟。\n晴日江光凛，秋星杀气缠。\n蓬蒿原自满，此别更萧然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2274,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登泰州城楼","author":"蒋春霖","text":"四野霜晴海气收，高城啸侣共登楼。\n旌旗杂遝连三郡，锁钥矜严重一州。\n西望云山成间阻，南飞乌鹊尚淹留。\n海陵自古雄争地，烟树苍苍起暮愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2275,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇  重九","author":"文廷式","text":"风紧天高，兴来欲射云间雁。\n平芜楚甸。\n漠漠清霜染。\n不省题糕，也少悲秋伴。\n登临健。\n兰芳菊艳。\n高想横汾宴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2276,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卜算子  水仙花","author":"文廷式","text":"香静玉盘安，影薄银屏绕。\n白石清泉偶遇之，不碍花光小。\n唱彻大江东，此意无人晓。\n若见湘皋解佩时，我自拌花恼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2277,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天","author":"文廷式","text":"蝶梦蘧然别有天，蝇钻故纸几何年。\n在山远志何如草，入世忘忧不藉萱。\n身外物，句中玄，一回揽镜一欣然。\n川如碧玉山如黛，不是吴儿也叩舷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2278,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南  咏雪","author":"文廷式","text":"天欲暮，旋觉白光寒。\n银阙半空俄隐现，琼林万树各飞翻。\n何处是三山。\n行且止，茸帽据征鞍。\n任是梅花开遍也，不曾春梦落人间。\n诗思已阑珊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2279,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"齐天乐 秋雨","author":"况周颐","text":"沈郎已自拚憔悴，惊心又闻秋雨。\n做冷欺灯，将愁续梦，越是宵深难住。\n千丝万缕。\n更搀入虫声，搅人情绪。\n一片萧骚，细听不是故园树。\n沈沈更漏渐咽，只檐前铁马，幽愁如诉。\n倘是残春，明朝怕有，无数飞花飞絮。\n天涯倦侣。\n记滴向篷窗，更加悽苦。\n欲谱潇湘，黯愁生玉柱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2280,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"久思","author":"蒋智由","text":"久思词笔换兜鍪，浩荡雄姿不可收。\n地覆天翻文字海，可能歌哭挽神州？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2281,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"有感","author":"蒋智由","text":"落落何人报大仇，沉沉往事泪长流。\n凄凉读尽支那史，几个男儿非马牛！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2282,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卢骚","author":"蒋智由","text":"世人皆欲杀，法国一卢骚。\n民约倡新义，君威扫旧骄。\n力填平等路，血灌自由苗。\n文字收功日，全球革命潮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2283,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金陵旧院","author":"蒋超","text":"锦袖歌残翠黛尘，楼台塌尽曲池湮。\n荒园一种瓢儿菜，独占秦淮旧日春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2284,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"黄山行","author":"释弘仁","text":"坐破苔衣第几重，梦中三十六芙蓉。\n倾来墨沈堪持赠，恍惚难名是某峰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2285,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"横塘夜泊","author":"宗渭","text":"偶为看山出，孤舟向暝停。\n野梅涵水白，渔火逗烟青。\n寒屿融残雪，春潭浴乱星。\n何人吹铁笛，清响破空冥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2286,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鸣弦泉","author":"释音可","text":"石上悬琴琴醉寒，五更三点是谁弹？\n清音流出相思泪，月照风吹竟不干。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2287,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题寒江钓雪图","author":"释敬安","text":"垂钓板桥东，雪压蓑衣冷。\n江寒水不流，鱼嚼梅花影。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2288,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦洞庭","author":"释敬安","text":"昨夜汲洞庭，君山青入瓶。\n倒之煮团月，还以浴繁星。\n一鹤从受戒，群龙来听经。\n何人忽吹笛，使我松间醒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2289,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"白芍药","author":"塞尔赫","text":"珠帘入夜卷琼钩，谢女怀香倚玉楼。\n风暖月明娇欲堕，依稀残梦在扬州。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2290,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙","author":"蒲松龄","text":"旧向长堤缆画桡，秋来秋色倍萧萧，空垂烟雨拂横桥。\n斜倚西风无限恨，懒将憔悴舞纤腰，离思别绪一条条。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2291,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清凉纪游一十四首 其一 入山","author":"胤禛","text":"清凉境界梵王宫，碧染芙蓉耸昊穹。\n万古云封五顶寺，千株松纳四时风。\n盘回鸟道珠幡里，缭绕炉烟画障中。\n石立俨然如接引，疑逢青髻化身童。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2292,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"隰西草堂","author":"靳应升","text":"虽少冬青树，犹余古薜萝。\n闲居真处士，枯坐老头陀。\n云水随缘过，江山入梦多。\n问津如有客，夜半看黄河。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2293,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄远","author":"熊湄","text":"几回闻雁忆连然，天末遥将锦字传。\n万里飘流羁远客，十年迢递阻回船。\n浮云目断苍山外，落月魂消洱海边。\n何日刀镮遂初约，免教暗卜掷金钱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2294,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渡江","author":"缪彤","text":"凉月漾中流，金山隐隐浮。\n尚馀残醉在，和梦到扬州。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2295,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"有感","author":"谭嗣同","text":"世间无物抵春愁，合向苍冥一哭休。\n四万万人齐下泪，天涯何处是神州。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2296,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过战鸟山","author":"谭嗣同","text":"冰玉相生愧独顽，可儿豪胆镇心关。\n悲秋剩有桓宣武，雪涕重经战鸟山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2297,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"牡丹佛手画幛七绝","author":"谭嗣同","text":"妙手空空感岁华，天风吹落赤城霞。\n不应既识西来意，一笑惟拈富贵花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2298,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"狱中题壁","author":"谭嗣同","text":"望门投止思张俭，忍死须臾待杜根。\n我自横刀向天笑，去留肝胆两昆仑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2299,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"潼关","author":"谭嗣同","text":"终古高云簇此城，秋风吹散马蹄声。\n河流大野犹嫌束，山入潼关解不平。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2300,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题宋徽宗画鹰","author":"谭嗣同","text":"落日平原拍手呼，画中神俊世非无。\n当年狐兔纵横甚，只少台臣似郅都。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2301,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰州庄严寺","author":"谭嗣同","text":"访僧入孤寺，一径苍苔深。\n寒磬秋花落，承尘破纸吟。\n潭光澄夕照，松翠下庭阴。\n不尽古时意，萧萧雅满林。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2302,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬夜","author":"谭嗣同","text":"班马肃清霜，严城暮色凉。\n镫青一电瞬，剑碧两龙长。\n调角急如语，寒星动有芒。\n遥怜诸将士，雪夜戍氐羌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2303,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"戊戌入都别友人","author":"谭嗣同","text":"家国两愁绝，人天一粲然。\n只余心独在，看汝更千年。\n世界几痕梦，微尘万座莲。\n后来凭吊意，分付此山川。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2304,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"似曾诗","author":"谭嗣同","text":"死生流转不相值，天地翻时忽一逢。\n且喜无情成解脱，欲追前事已冥蒙。\n桐花院落乌头白，芳草汀洲雁泪红。\n隔世金环弹指过，结空为色又俄空。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2305,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"似曾诗","author":"谭嗣同","text":"同住莲花证四禅，空然一笑是横阗。\n惟红法雨偶生色，被黑罡风吹堕天。\n大患有身无相定，小言破道遣愁篇。\n年来嚼蜡成滋味，阑入楞严十种仙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2306,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"似曾诗","author":"谭嗣同","text":"无端过去生中事，兜上朦胧业眼来。\n灯下髑髅谁一剑，尊前尸冢梦三槐。\n金裘喷血和天斗，云竹闻歌匝地哀。\n徐甲傥容心忏悔，愿身成骨骨成灰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2307,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江行","author":"谭嗣同","text":"野犬吠丛薄，深林知有村。\n岸荒群动寂，月缺暝烟昏。\n渔火随星出，云帆夹浪奔。\n橹声惊断梦，摇曳起江根。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2308,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"角声","author":"谭嗣同","text":"江汉夜滔滔，严城片月高。\n声随风咽鼓，泪杂酒沾袍。\n思妇劳人怨，长歌短剑豪。\n壮怀消不尽，马首向临洮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2309,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"武昌夜泊","author":"谭嗣同","text":"秋老夜苍苍，鸡鸣天雨霜。\n星河千里白，鼓角一城凉。\n镫炫新番舶，磷啼旧战场。\n青山终不改，人事费兴亡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2310,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"除夕感怀","author":"谭嗣同","text":"年华世事两迷离，敢道中原鹿死谁。\n自向冰天炼奇骨，暂教佳句属通眉。\n无端歌哭因长夜，婪尾阴阳胜此时。\n有约闻鸡同起舞，灯前转恨漏声迟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2311,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"除夕感怀","author":"谭嗣同","text":"我辈虫吟真碌碌，高歌《商颂》彼何人。\n十年醉梦天难醒，一寸芳心镜不尘。\n挥洒琴尊辞旧岁，安排险阻著孤身。\n乾坤剑气双龙啸，唤起幽潜共好春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2312,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"除夕感怀","author":"谭嗣同","text":"内顾何曾足肝胆，论交晚乃得髯翁。\n不观器识才终隐，即较文词势已雄。\n逃酒人随霜阵北，谈兵心逐海潮东。\n飞光自抚将三十，山简生来忧患中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2313,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"除夕感怀","author":"谭嗣同","text":"断送古今惟岁月，昏昏腊酒又迎年。\n谁知羲仲寅宾日，已是共工缺陷天。\n桐待凤鸣心不死，泽因龙起腹难坚。\n寒灰自分终消歇，赖有诗兵斗火田。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2314,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"桂花五律","author":"谭嗣同","text":"湘上野烟轻，芙蓉落晚晴。\n桂花秋一苑，凉露夜三更。\n香满随云散，人归趁月明。\n谁知小山意，惆怅遍江城！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2315,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晨登衡岳祝融峰","author":"谭嗣同","text":"身高殊不绝，四顾乃无峰。\n但有浮云度，时时一荡胸。\n地沉星尽没，天跃日初熔。\n半勺洞庭水，秋寒欲起龙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2316,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"道吾山","author":"谭嗣同","text":"夕阳悬高树，薄暮入青峰。\n古寺云依鹤，空潭月照龙。\n尘消百尺瀑，心断一声钟。\n禅意渺何著，啾啾阶下蛩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2317,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"儿缆船","author":"谭嗣同","text":"北风蓬蓬，大浪雷吼，小儿曳缆逆风走。\n惶惶船中人，生死在儿手。\n缆倒曳儿儿屡仆，持缆愈力缆縻肉，儿肉附缆去，儿掌惟见骨。\n掌见骨，儿莫哭，儿掌有白骨，江心无白骨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2318,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"三鸳鸯篇","author":"谭嗣同","text":"辘轳鸣，秋风晚，寒日荒荒下秋苑。\n辘轳鸣，井水寒，三更络绎啼井栏。\n鸳鸯憔悴不成双，两雌一雄鸣铿锵。\n哀鸣声何长，飞飞入银塘。\n银塘浅，翠带结。\n塘水枯，带不绝。\n愁魂夜啸缺月低，惊起城头乌磔磔。\n城头乌，朝朝饮水鸳鸯湖。\n曾见莲底鸳鸯日来往，忘却罗敷犹有夫。\n夫怒啄雄，雄去何栖，翩然归来，闭此幽闺。\n幽闺匿迹那可久，花里秦宫君知否？\n不如万古一丘，长偕三百首。\n幽闺人去灯光寂，照见罗帏泪痕湿。\n同穴居然愿不虚，岁岁春风土花碧。\n并蒂不必莲，连理不必木，痴骨千年同一束。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2319,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"似曾诗","author":"谭嗣同","text":"柳花夙有何冤业，萍末相遭乃尔奇。\n直到化泥方是聚，祗今堕水尚成离。\n焉能忍此而终古，亦与之为无町畦。\n我佛天亲魔眷属，一时撒手劫僧祗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2320,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"河梁吟","author":"谭嗣同","text":"沙漠多雄风，四顾浩茫茫。\n落日下平地，萧萧人影长。\n抚剑起巡酒，悲歌慨以慷。\n束发远行游，转战在四方。\n天地苟不毁，离合会有常。\n车尘灭远道，道远安可忘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2321,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]